# STLs/zips are committed as normal Git objects (NOT LFS) so Vercel serves the
# real files — Vercel does not materialize Git LFS objects on deploy, which broke
# the 3D previews and downloads. They're small enough (~tens of MB) for plain git.
#
# Hardware/product images are not in this repo at all -- not as blobs, not as
# LFS. They live only on the bucket, pinned in slicer/parts.json as `image_url`
# (see scripts/fetch_product_images.py). They were briefly LFS-tracked, which
# published 130-byte pointer stubs under valid-looking content hashes and broke
# every hardware photo on the site.
